| Mechanism | What the current record rules out |
|---|---|
| More arithmetic descent on the same conditions | The repaired descent-invariance lemma transports those conditions; it supplies no new exclusions. Child-specific conditions require their own proof. |
| Child integrality in the current window | R063 is excluded; the six disputed family-B rows survive the complete printed test. No further yield at n <= 200 is banked. |
