+
+## Evidence boundary and decision
+
+Blind against `/tmp/jc2-lane.mY16GQ/inputs`; packet SHA-256 `ca5a70c9d32d72bead8f71a63126ccdf9498231395da9d7ac0806804381f9d78` verified. No 1435 root/peer submission or live D125 work consumed. Two same-model research subagents checked bounded questions; this is not different-model review.
